# NaMiOS vi_NM overlay for the KIO framework (domain kio6).
# Fills untranslated/rescues fuzzy high-visibility file-dialog, Places and file-operation
# strings; also normalizes key Places names to the NaMiOS glossary. Overlay language vi_NM
# wins per-message via LANGUAGE=vi_NM:vi:en_US. Source: KDE l10n-vi trunk6/messages/kio/kio6.po.
# NOTE: the Open/Save file dialog + Places live in the kio6 domain in KF6 (kio/src/filewidgets/*);
# there is no separate kfilewidgets6 .mo. msgfmt-clean.
